{"name":"Everlasting Sage","hex":"#949587","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"everlasting","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Lasting or enduring forever; endless, eternal.\n\nChiefly of a deity or other supernatural being: having always existed and will continue to exist forever; eternal.\n\n Synonym of sempiternal (“having infinite temporal duration, rather than outside time and thus lacking temporal duration altogether”).","Chiefly of a deity or other supernatural being: having always existed and will continue to exist forever; eternal."]},{"part":"Adverb","definitions":["Synonym of everlastingly.\n Used as an intensifier: extremely, very.\n\n In an everlasting (adjective sense 1) manner; forever.","Used as an intensifier: extremely, very."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/everlasting"},{"term":"sage","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Wise.","Grave; serious; solemn."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A very wise person or spiritual teacher; someone of gravity and wisdom, especially, a teacher venerable for years, and of sound judgment and prudence; a grave or stoic philosopher."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sage"}],"entries":[{"title":"Everlasting (Natalie Cole album)","blocks":[{"text":"Everlasting is the eleventh studio album by American singer Natalie Cole, released on June 14, 1987 by Manhattan Records. The album was certified gold by the Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA). Cole earned a nomination for Best Female R&B Vocal Performance at the 1988 Grammy Awards."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1c/Everlasting_Natalie_Cole_album.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Everlasting_(Natalie_Cole_album)"},{"title":"Sage (color)","blocks":[{"text":"Sage is a grey-green resembling that of dried sage leaves. As a quaternary color, it is an equal mix of the tertiary colors citron and slate. The hex RGB color value of the adjacent sage swatch is BCB88A. For decades, some military flight jackets were made in sage green."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b2/Sage_iPhone_17.jpg/330px-Sage_iPhone_17.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sage_(color)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/55/Natalie_Cole_Everlasting_UK_album_cover.jpg/250px-Natalie_Cole_Everlasting_UK_album_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/55/Natalie_Cole_Everlasting_UK_album_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/55/Natalie_Cole_Everlasting_UK_album_cover.jpg/250px-Natalie_Cole_Everlasting_UK_album_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANatalie_Cole_Everlasting_UK_album_cover.jpg"}],"sounds":{"everlasting":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/En-us-everlasting.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/af/En-us-everlasting.ogg/En-us-everlasting.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-everlasting.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-everlasting.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Naomi_Persephone_Amethyst_%28NaomiAmethyst%29-everlasting.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; c